# The bundled OpenAPI document is a committed artefact, not build output: it
# is the contract clients are generated from and the file CI diffs for drift.
# The repository-wide `dist/` rule would otherwise swallow it, and a parent
# rule that excludes a directory cannot be undone file by file — the
# directory itself has to be re-included.
!/openapi/dist/
